     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Acknowledging without over-promising",
     "texto": [
      "Open by acknowledging the inconvenience; say what has been checked and what still needs investigating. Avoid admitting or denying facts that haven't been verified. Propose a realistic timeframe for updating the person and say who will follow up."
     ],
